'''Spookality 2026''' is the 10th edition of the annual [[wikipedia:Halloween|Halloween]]-themed VRChat [[Special:MyLanguage/Events|event]]. It is an [[Avatars|avatar]] and [[Worlds|world]] jam. Themes remain unannounced.<ref name="DU2026-08-27">[https://ask.vrchat.com/t/developer-update-27-august-2026/48877 "Developer Update - 27 August 2026"] on ''ask.vrchat.com''; dated August 27, 2026; retrieved August 27, 2026.</ref>

